    ],
    [Real Estate Development:Our team manages every phase of property development, from site acquisition and design to construction oversight and final delivery, creating value-driven and sustainable communities.
    ],
    [Retail Malls & Commercial Spaces:We design and build high-traffic retail environments and informal markets optimised for functionality, accessibility, and operational efficiency.
    ],
    [Interior & Exterior Design:We craft aesthetic and functional spaces with precision, ensuring a harmonious balance of detail, flow, and finish, both inside and out.
