{file:marine_services.html,
page_title:Marine Services,
paragraph_title:Integrated Marine Excellence,
paragraph_1:CEMEX Marine Services delivers comprehensive offshore, inshore, and onshore support for the global energy sector. We are the strategic partner for complex marine environments, integrating vessel chartering, advanced logistics, custom fabrication, and elite staffing to ensure your operations flow without interruption.,
paragraph_2:Our focus is on mitigating risk and maximising efficiency. By unifying disparate services into one cohesive solution, we solve the industry's toughest logistical challenges. We deploy our trusted expertise and rigorous safety protocols to navigate evolving demands, providing the operational certainty you need to succeed in even the most demanding marine environments.,
core_capabilities: [Marine Operations:We offer flexible vessel chartering for service boats, barges, and houseboats, alongside custom equipment fabrication, drydocking, and maintenance to keep your assets safe, compliant, and efficient.
    ],
    [Logistics & Supply Chain:Our services include reliable leasing for essential project equipment (forklifts, tractors, portacabins), swift logistics support to streamline offshore operations, and cost-effective procurement through strong supplier partnerships.
    ],
    [Manpower & Workforce Solutions:We provide end-to-end recruitment, deployment, and management of skilled personnel, project managers, and supervisors tailored to the oil, gas, and energy sectors.
    ],
    [Crew & Welfare Services:We ensure a high standard of living for offshore teams through comprehensive hospitality, housekeeping, catering, and holistic welfare programs that enhance morale and productivity.
    ]
},
{file:power_solutions.html,
page_title:Power Solutions,
paragraph_title:Empowering Growth Through Reliable Energy,
paragraph_1:CEMEX Power Solutions engineers and delivers reliable, efficient, and scalable energy systems that empower industries, businesses, and communities. We specialise in providing uninterrupted power customised for your precise operational needs, ensuring you can operate with total confidence and focus on sustainable growth.,
paragraph_2:From advanced renewable energy projects to comprehensive Independent Power Producer (IPP) plants, we manage the entire lifecycle. Our services eliminate downtime and financial risk by providing full asset provision, operations, and maintenance under a usage-based billing model. This zero-capital-investment approach guarantees consistent power continuity, allowing you to dedicate all your resources to your core business.,
core_capabilities: [Renewable Energy Solutions:We design, build, and operate solar, gas, and diesel power plants to produce clean energy for the grid or for specific clients.
    ],
    [Independent Power Producer (IPP):We operate gas, diesel, solar, and hybrid plants to deliver uninterrupted electricity for malls, estates, industries, and other large-scale clients.
    ],
    [Project Development:Our team expertly manages all permits, licenses, and infrastructure development required for successful renewable energy initiatives.
    ],
    [Net Metering:We provide on-site system installation, allowing customers to be billed for their net energy usage and optimise costs.
    ]
}